    {
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "399404cc9281302d",
      "line_num": 113,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#feature",
        "#kanban"
      ],
      "text": "**Inline TODO completion tracking: Snapshot-and-diff approach to detect when inline TODOs are removed between scans and show them as completed in the Done column. Uses `.todoscope-snapshot.json` and `.todoscope-done.json`. Git-history-independent \u2014 works on shallow clones.**\n`#feature` `#kanban`\n`TODO.md:L113`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 10,
      "y": 60
    },
    {
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "7ab7f917a4e30dc0",
      "line_num": 114,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#feature",
        "#editor",
        "#kanban"
      ],
      "text": "**TODO editor + checkbox write-back: Interactive checkboxes on kanban cards that write back to TODO.md. Includes atomic mutations, optimistic concurrency, advisory file locking, add-TODO form, and merge conflict detection.**\n`#feature` `#editor` `#kanban`\n`TODO.md:L114`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 10,
      "y": 150
    },
    {
